; Gezira renders KSWorld documents in an SDL3 window, with the mouse: what's being built, what each piece builds on, and what
; would show it works.  MARU_PLAN=render notes/plan/record asks the checks; MARU_PLAN=render ./eval notes/plan/next.l says
; what's next.  The Nile runtime's pieces follow doc/plans/2026-10-15-nile-runtime-in-maru.md (RFC
; doc/rfc/draft-ndn-nile-runtime-in-maru-02.md); the document's side builds on notes/plan/ksworld.john.

start-world plan.
load "notes/plan/probes.l".

set Evidence = untested | passed(tree) | failed(tree)
  | tested(tree, trials) | proved(tree, cases) | refuted(tree, counterexample) | starved(tree, met, drawn)
  | vacuous(tree) | inconclusive(tree, input).
group Good passed tested proved.

group Check Case Measure Grammar Law.
create Case evidence last-good.
create Measure evidence last-good command cadence.
create Grammar evidence last-good file class rule host inherits samples.
create Law evidence last-good file support.
qualify Case observe is it case-passes.
qualify Measure observe is it command-succeeds.
qualify Grammar observe is it compiles-and-reads.
qualify Law observe is it law-verdict.
qualify Check routine if 1 = 1.
qualify Measure routine if its cadence = "routine".

make Measure WholeSuite untested untested "nice make check" "full".
make Measure Erosion untested untested "./eval notes/plan/erosion-hotspots.l" "full".

; the Nile runtime in typed Maru, task by task
make Case nile_interface untested untested.
make Case nile_osdefs untested untested.
make Case nile_startup untested untested.
make Case nile_recip untested untested.
make Case nile_limits untested untested.
make Case nile_oom untested untested.
make Case nile_prefix untested untested.
make Case nile_reroute untested untested.
make Case nile_reverse untested untested.
make Case nile_sort untested untested.
make Case nile_dupcat untested untested.
make Case nile_laws untested untested.			; the built-ins hold to their definitions, the same on 1, 4 and 8 workers
make Case nile_schedules untested untested.		; and keep the runtime's contracts under generated thread schedules
make Case nile_text_layout untested untested.
; what draws, and where
make Case gezira_image untested untested.			; a Gezira scene rendered to pixels, as the C runtime renders it
make Case sdl3_window untested untested.			; a window shows a pixel buffer, and mouse events come back
make Case ksworld_headless untested untested.		; a document's streams run, and its boxes' paths are asked of a Gezira
make Case ksworld_pixels untested untested.		; KSWorld.ks's pixels in a window: its bar, background, a filled shape, glyphs
; cases that were planned and never written, or written under other names: their answers stay in the ledger, unread
retired ksworld_render.				; ksworld_pixels shows a document's pixels
retired ksworld_text.				; ksworld_headless lays its text out with TrueType glyphs
retired nile_threads.				; nile_laws runs the built-ins on 1, 4 and 8 workers
retired nile_tsan.				; nile_schedules finds races by schedule, not a sanitizer
make Case ksworld_mouse untested untested.		; a click lands on the box under it, fires its streams, and the redraw shows it

create Code tree.
action Check observed Answer consequence its evidence = Answer and its last-good = Answer if Answer is Good.
; a check's state is what the world holds (doc/rfc/draft-ndn-maru-john-development-00.md): its latest answer, and the
; last good one, which observed keeps, so nothing is worked out again from the answers before
qualify Check holds if its evidence is Good and its evidence tree = Now tree.
qualify Check failing if not its evidence is Good and not its evidence is untested and its evidence tree = Now tree.
qualify Check regressed if it failing = yes and its last-good is Good.
qualify Check stale if not its evidence is untested and not its evidence tree = Now tree.
qualify Check untested if its evidence is untested.

create Capability what where shown-by builds-on planned.
make Capability NileInterface "nile.k is the one interface; the Maru generator passes sizeof_vars"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile.k" [ nile_interface ] [ ] no.
make Capability NileThreads "pthread types sized from nile.osdefs; a worker pool that starts, syncs and shuts down"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile-sync.k, nile-heap.k, nile-deque.k, nile-thread.k" [ nile_osdefs, nile_startup ] [ NileInterface ] no.
make Capability NileProcesses "processes and the kernel interface, with the limits and running out of memory"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile-process.k, nile-kernel.k" [ nile_recip, nile_limits, nile_oom, nile_prefix, nile_reroute ] [ NileThreads ] no.
make Capability NileBuiltins "the remaining built-ins, and every thread count giving the same answer, race-free"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile-builtins.k" [ nile_reverse, nile_sort, nile_dupcat, nile_laws, nile_schedules ] [ NileProcesses ] no.
make Capability NileEndToEnd "text-layout.nl runs end to end through Maru, as the C runtime ran it"
  "nile/, check/check.l" [ nile_text_layout ] [ NileBuiltins ] no.
make Capability GeziraImage "Gezira's kernels, compiled through Maru, render a scene to pixels"
  "gezira/, the Nile runtime" [ gezira_image ] [ NileEndToEnd ] no.
make Capability Sdl3Window "an SDL3 window shows a pixel buffer each frame and hands back mouse and key events"
  "sdl3.osdefs, sdl3.k" [ sdl3_window ] [ ] no.
make Capability DocumentScene "a document's boxes ask a Gezira to fill their shapes' paths, each placed by its matrix and painted in its fill"
  "ksworld-render.l" [ ksworld_headless ] [ ] no.
make Capability DocumentText "a document's text spans are laid out with TrueType glyph outlines, quadratic Béziers Gezira draws"
  "a TrueType byte grammar, ksworld-text.l" [ ksworld_headless ] [ DocumentScene ] no.
make Capability DocumentRendered "a document is rendered through Gezira to pixels: its bar, background, a filled shape and its glyphs where KSWorld put them"
  "ksworld-render.l" [ ksworld_pixels ] [ GeziraImage, DocumentText ] no.
make Capability MouseHandled "in an SDL3 window, a click lands on the box under it, fires its streams, and the redraw shows it"
  "ksworld-window.l" [ ksworld_mouse ] [ DocumentRendered, Sdl3Window ] no.
make Capability NothingElseBroke "every other check in the repository still passes"
  "the whole tree" [ WholeSuite ] [ MouseHandled ] no.

qualify Capability proven if its shown-by size > 0 and for every its shown-by do each holds = yes.
qualify Capability done if it proven = yes or it planned = yes.
qualify Capability ready if for every its builds-on do each done = yes.
qualify Capability regressing if for some its shown-by do each regressed = yes.
qualify Capability failing if for some its shown-by do (each failing = yes and each regressed = no).
qualify Capability aging if for some its shown-by do each stale = yes.
qualify Capability untried if for some its shown-by do each untested = yes.
rel-qualify Capability:A depends-on Capability:B if B in A builds-on.
rel-qualify Check:C supports Capability:K if C in K shown-by.

create Team.
make Team T.
action Team build Capability consequence Capability planned = yes.
create Hotspot callable file line cc mass tree planned.	; a callable over CC 10 (erosion-run.l --hotspots), for this code
qualify Hotspot current if its tree = Now tree.
action Team simplify Hotspot consequence Hotspot planned = yes.
rule Team simplify is Hotspot current = yes.
rule Team simplify is Hotspot planned = no.
rule Team build is Capability done = no.
rule Team build is Capability ready = yes.
goal Team deliver try for every all Capability do each done = yes.
; what the next step is worth: a regression first, then a failure, then answers about older code, then what's untried,
; and less erosion: each hotspot left costs its mass
heuristic Team deliver 10000 maximize (select all Capability by which planned = yes and which regressing = yes) size.
heuristic Team deliver 1000 maximize (select all Capability by which planned = yes and which failing = yes) size.
heuristic Team deliver 100 maximize (select all Capability by which planned = yes and which aging = yes) size.
heuristic Team deliver 10 maximize (select all Capability by which planned = yes and which untried = yes) size.
heuristic Team deliver 1 minimize total (select all Hotspot by which planned = no and which current = yes) by which mass.
goal-strategy Team deliver sat.
